import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 126 | Realm Refinement · Law Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 126 | Realm Refinement · Law Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","no":126,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Law Origin Realm","Cultivation Risks","Breakthrough Costs","Alaya Supervision"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","48-Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0126_模块1-法元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md","filePath":"en/0126_模块1-法元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"}'),n={name:"en/0126_模块1-法元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,u,c){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-126-law-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 126 | Law Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-126-law-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 126 | Law Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 19, 28, 48</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-first-major-bottleneck-and-also-the-first-high-risk-threshold" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The first major bottleneck, and also the first high-risk threshold <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-first-major-bottleneck-and-also-the-first-high-risk-threshold" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The first major bottleneck, and also the first high-risk threshold&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Transform Realm (Entry 119) risks were in &quot;product loss of control&quot;; Law Realm risks escalate to &quot;law loss of control.&quot; When cultivators can preliminarily manipulate laws, one misjudgment may trigger local law turbulence — this is the first time individual cultivation gains the ability to &quot;rewrite public rules,&quot; and also the first high-risk threshold on the mortal-cultivation path. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision&#39;s task in this realm escalates from &quot;watching products&quot; to &quot;watching law operations.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the value origin of the supervision mechanism: the anti-predation axiom — the first mission of supervision is to make body-snatching and Dao-seizing nowhere to hide; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — supervision treats all Myriad Races equally; the collective ascension axiom — guarding law operations is guarding civilization&#39;s public rules; the causal self-discipline axiom — manipulating laws most requires observe-first, limited-interfer-second; the law-first axiom — the Law Realm supervision framework is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-four-core-risks-of-the-law-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Four Core Risks of the Law Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-core-risks-of-the-law-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Core Risks of the Law Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Law turbulence: manipulating immature laws triggers local rule turbulence, affecting surrounding environment and life</li><li>Consciousness overload: unregulated deep deduction overdraws consciousness strength, qi deviation risk surges</li><li>Body-snatching and Dao-seizing: what predatory remnants most want to seize is the Law Realm cultivator&#39;s law comprehension</li><li>Shortcut inner demon: the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon in this realm upgrades to &quot;seizing others&#39; law comprehension for instant ascension&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="ii-breakthrough-costs-real-but-controllable-and-reversible" tabindex="-1">II. Breakthrough Costs: Real, But Controllable and Reversible <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-breakthrough-costs-real-but-controllable-and-reversible" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Breakthrough Costs: Real, But Controllable and Reversible&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Breaking through from the Law Realm to the Dao Realm requires real costs:</p><ul><li>Time cost: normal path takes over a decade to decades (Document 14); the first major bottleneck cannot be compressed</li><li>Comprehension cost: when comprehension is insufficient, no amount of resource dumping helps; only the education system can supplement</li><li>Consciousness cost: deep deduction&#39;s consciousness consumption is real</li><li>Failure cost: breakthrough failure triggers law backlash, but the anchor repair mechanism ensures reversibility</li></ul><h2 id="iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision-closed-loop" tabindex="-1">III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision Closed Loop <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision-closed-loop" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision Closed Loop&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Anchor automatic monitoring: real-time monitoring of law operation amplitude, exceeding limits triggers instant warning</li><li>Law operation filing: all law fine-tunings must be filed; cross-plane law operations additionally require anchor connection filing (Document 28)</li><li>Ethical review: advanced law spells require ethical review (Document 19)</li><li>Judicial backstop: body-snatching, Dao-seizing, and law weaponization are major crimes, tried by the Anchor Court according to law (Document 48)</li><li>Publicity objection period: thirty days of publicity, all Myriad Races may raise objections</li></ul><h2 id="iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-law-realm" tabindex="-1">IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Law Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-law-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Law Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Informed consent: law operations involving others must obtain consent</li><li>Minimum harm: law turbulence risks must be released under control in isolation chambers</li><li>Accountability: Law Realm cultivators must undertake senior mentor or middle-management obligations</li></ul><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-law-manipulation-hazards-amplify-in-the-dao-realm" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Law Manipulation Hazards Amplify in the Dao Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-law-manipulation-hazards-amplify-in-the-dao-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Law Manipulation Hazards Amplify in the Dao Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The supervision system&#39;s meaning in the Law Realm is clearest at cross-realm handover: an unreported law misoperation in the Law Realm leaves law turbulence traces that, when establishing Dao in the Dao Realm, become cracks between the personal Dao and cosmic laws. Similarly, if body-snatching and Dao-seizing risks in the Law Realm are not eradicated, predatory remnants&#39; Dao-seizing attempts intensify when the cultivator enters the Dao Realm to establish Dao. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision therefore list &quot;Law Realm law operation records and Dao-heart purity&quot; as a mandatory item before Dao Realm breakthrough: any undisposed law turbulence or unconfirmed Dao-heart hidden wound must be handled before passage. This rule guards the cultivator&#39;s Dao-heart foundation — once the Dao-heart is cracked, no matter how beautiful the Dao established, it cannot withstand falsification.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: supervision makes every law operation safe and controllable, not wasting comprehension on qi deviation</li><li>Anti-predation: striking &quot;body-snatching and Dao-seizing&quot; at the source, keeping law comprehension forever in the cultivator&#39;s own consciousness</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system had no law operation supervision, the strong changed rules at will; Heng Yuan Zhou has full-stack guardianship</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: supervision treats 99% of Myriad Races equally; planetary star-core fine-tuning is equally filed</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: every link of openness is paired with guardianship</li></ul><p>The pre-check of Dao-heart purity seems more &quot;ethereal&quot; than products and law operations, but is actually the highest-level safety check. Because once the Dao is established crooked, all subsequent realms walk with that crookedness, and the higher up the harder to correct. The Alaya Network putting Dao-heart hidden wounds on the table is essentially, before the cultivator invests decades in establishing Dao, confirming the direction is right — wrong direction, the harder the effort the farther from the right path. This pre-gatekeeping is precisely the causal self-discipline axiom landing from the operation layer deep into the mind-consciousness layer.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Law Realm&#39;s supervisory philosophy remains: control risks, keep costs real, keep the road open. When every law operation is filed and every turbulence triggers instant warning, Myriad Race cultivators can放心 touch the rules themselves — because they know an entire civilization has their back.</p><p>Taking the Dao-heart seriously is taking direction seriously. The Alaya Network willing to invest effort in the most &quot;ethereal&quot; Dao-heart precisely shows that symbiotic civilization is not a brute-force system only watching energy metrics, but a mature civilization that truly understands &quot;wrong direction makes all effort wasted.&quot;</p><p>Right direction, slow is fast; wrong direction, fast is empty. This is the simplest yet deepest truth of Law Realm supervision.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./28-跨位面锚点连接.html">28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./48-司法体系与裁决机制.html">48-Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const p=a(n,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
